  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32>Choose Your Free Games Feature

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<style=title><size=32>Free Games & Re-Spin Feature

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32>Jackpot Bonus Games

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<style=title><size=32>RANDOM MULTIPLIER WILD FEATURE

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=20>- Full Stacks of Bonus symbols on reels 2, 3, and 4 triggers
      the 'Choose Your Free Games' feature.\r\n- User may choose among 5 fixed options
      and 1 mystery option.\r\n- Each option has a different symbol and number of
      free games. \r\n- Mystery option will be a random combination of a symbol and
      number of free games.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=18>- In Free Games, whenever user's chosen symbol appears in full
      stacks, trigger Hold & Re-Spin.\r\n- 1 Re-Spin will be given regardless of the
      number of full stacks that appeared.\r\n- All full stacks of the chosen symbol
      get locked on screen, while remaining reels re-spin.\r\n- If additional chosen
      symbols appear in full stacks, calculate line pay, lock the newest full stacks,
      and award \n  1 more Re-Spin. \r\n- Re-Spin feature ends when no additional
      chosen symbols appear in full stacks, or if the screen is full of the\n   chosen
      symbol. \r\n- During Free Games, if full stacks of Bonus symbols appear on reels
      2, 3 and 4, re-trigger Free Games and \n  award the same number of spins as
      initially awarded."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=19>- Full Stacks of Jackpot symbols on reels 2, 3 and 4 triggers
      the Jackpot Bonus Games.\n- In the Jackpot Bonus, only gem symbols and blank
      symbols appear. \n- There is a Jackpot Wheel above each reel with different
      number of wedge slices.\n- If gem symbols appear in full stacks on any of the
      reels, one wedge slice will be activated on the wheel.\n- Reels, Jackpot Reward,
      Gem Symbols, and Wheel Wedges work as the following.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<size=19>End Jackpot Bonus Games if all of the wedge slices are activated
      for a certain Jackpot Wheel. \nIt is possible for multiple Jackpots to be awarded
      at the same time.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: "<size=19>- End Jackpot Bonus Games if all of the wedge slices are activated
      for a certain Jackpot Wheel. \r\n- It is possible for multiple Jackpots to be
      awarded at the same time.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
